==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
*1 [[Moe Uzumasa & Doge]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*1 [[Saki Matsuga & Doge]] spawns after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*1 [[Misa Ono & Doge]] spawns after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage is not as difficult as it seems as all three of the main enemies have low damage per hit and the Doge Darks provide plenty of money. [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] and [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]] are able to deal with all of the enemies besides Misa Ono & Doge. If you are really having trouble with Misa Ono & Doge, bring [[Nerd Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Cyberpunk Cat]] which is able to effectively hit it from a safe range.

